      "content": "i hear you but it feels really dramatic. i feel fine when i'm just sitting still, it's only the deep breaths that feel heavy. i've had cramps like this before after long car rides. honestly i just think i need to relax. can u just tell me if there's anything else i can take to help the swelling in my leg so i can just sleep? like maybe a topical cream or something instead of going all the way to the hospital?",
